    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get what you're saying about the tyramine, but I'm really worried about my protein intake because I work out a lot and if I cut out all those things I'll lose my progress. Is there any way I can just take something else to balance it out? Like, if I take a blood pressure pill or something like a little bit of aspirin before I eat my cheese, would that make it safe enough to enjoy my food without the risk?",
